  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Sugaree** (1 review): Reviewer singles out this song's performance on the Peluso recording as especially fantastic [6]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mama Tried**: rare: 7 archived performances [9]\n- **Easy Wind**: rare: 14 archived performances [9]\n- **Dear Mr. Fantasy/Hey Jude Reprise**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **St. Stephen/William Tell Bridge**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-06-01.peluso.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 187 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]\n- **deadco2023-06-01.nak.flac16**: source not stated; 16 songs; 187 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [2]. Said about its sound: Reviewer hears a far-field lawn recording with CP-4 mics, good soundstage, and warmth contributed by the PSP preamp [5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Traffic around the venue was bad, though milder than at the Charlotte show; friends handled navigation and parking so taper could reach lawn spot [1]\n- Sold-out venue had bad traffic; friends handled navigation and parking so taper could hurry up the hill to a good spot [2]\n- Traffic outside was heavy, but not as bad as at the earlier Charlotte show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-06-01.peluso.flac16**: taped by Chris Davis and George; transferred by Chris Davis; source: Peluso cemc6/ck41 [Rainey/lawn/dfc] -> Sound Devices MP-2 -> Tascam DR-680 [24/48] [1]. Also: Transfer went through Wavelab with matrixing and fades, CD Wave, UV22HR dithering, then FLAC encoding. Taped by Chris Davis and George [1]\n- **deadco2023-06-01.nak.flac16**: taped by Chris Davis and George; transferred by Chris Davis; source: Nakamachi cm100/cp4 [Rainey/lawn/dfc] -> E.A.A. PSP-2 -> Tascam DR-680 [24/48] [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Worthpoint: [🌹💃 Dead & Company Poster Raleigh Walnut Creek 2023 JT Lucchesi #/1800 | #4703283112](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/dead-company-poster-raleigh-walnut-4703283112) [10]\n- Poster by Worthpoint: [🌹💃 Dead & Company Poster Raleigh Walnut Creek 2023 JT Lucchesi #/1800 | #4703283112](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/dead-company-poster-raleigh-walnut-4703283112) [11]",
